    ],
    "text": "I, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation, hereby declare under Sub section (1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the lands mentioned below are needed for a public Purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act. The allotments of land depicted in Advance Tracing No. Ma/UKW/2021/420 dated 21.04.2022, prepared by the Surveyor General in the Halangoda and Balakaduwa Villages in Grama Niladhari Divisions, Halangoda (E 347A) and Balakaduwa (E 357D) of Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Ukuwela in the District of Matale, Central Province and bounded as follows; 01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Batakotuwe Hena \u2013 Extent: 0.0037 Hectare North: Road Development Authority Road and Batakotuwe Hena claimed by Jayawardana H.A; East: Batakotuwe Hena claimed by Jayawardana H.A and Balakaduwa Oya; South: Balakaduwa Oya and Batakotuwe Hena claimed by Jayawardana; West: Batakotuwe Hena claimed by Jayawardana and Road Development Authority Road.",
